umb/sc12p2m.jpg"}], "slug": "the-utility-room", "storyline": "The Utility Room is not a traditional VR game. It is not inspired by anything. It is not set in a cyberpunk-Esque city 150 years in the future. There's no shooting or flashing lights or gumball machine gameplay. It is a place that no one has ever seen or visited and it is a place where you do not belong.\n\nMost entities that inhabit this world will pay little attention to you. Though It needs to be said that this world is a lot bigger than you are. It is dangerous, and nothing will account for your safety.", "summary": "This VR Journey takes you to the 'behind the scenes' of the Universe. Beyond a door lies a barren landscape inhabited by strange stonefaced beings. Here, the maintenance and heavy lifting required keeps existence stable and temporal. You are a tourist. Don't do anything foolish.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-utility-room", "videos": [{"id": 78280, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "4krA8kKEmiE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4krA8kKEmiE", "title": "THE UTILITY ROOM - VR Gameplay Teaser #1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4krA8kKEmiE/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 78281, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "nW_Ayp_-Fc0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nW_Ayp_-Fc0", "title": "THE UTILITY ROOM - VR Teaser #2", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nW_Ayp_-Fc0/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 179609, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MYao_ksy2qI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYao_ksy2qI", "title": "The Utility Room - Announcement Trailer | PS VR2 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MYao_ksy2qI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 179610, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "oZbi1C8xanI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZbi1C8xanI", "title": "The Utility Room | Full VR Journey | No Commentary |\ud83d\uddff", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oZbi1C8xanI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}